WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.718 --> 00:00:09.809
This page mixes practice questions from every week so far into one set, so ideas stay alive instead of fading after their week ends.

2
00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:15.299
Answer a mixed practice question drawn from anywhere in the course so far.

3
00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:21.532
Then mark how sure you were. The report uses this to surface confident mistakes first.

4
00:00:21.532 --> 00:00:25.967
See how you did, with the reasoning, not just the answer.

5
00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:31.892
Trust the ordering, read the calibration report at the end, and come back weekly.
